A default order comparison (<code>&lt;</code>, <code>&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;=</code>, and <code>&gt;=</code>) is not provided;
an attempt raises <a href="https://docs.python.org/3.13/library/exceptions.html#TypeError" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" title="TypeError"><code>TypeError</code></a>.  A motivation for this default behavior is
the lack of a similar invariant as for equality.
